a Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达正式量产并交付Vera CPU，专为Agentic AI负载打造</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI面向ChatGPT Pro用户推出金融工具，支持直连超1.2万家银行账户</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cursor发布Composer 2.5编程模型，性能对标GPT-5.5并大幅降低成本</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云发布通义千问Qwen3.7预览版，Max与Plus版本上线竞技场</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/595447188a495841522150440d4d4c4f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里云正式发布通义千问新一代旗舰模型Qwen3.7-Max-Preview与Qwen3.7-Plus-Preview，目前已上线大模型竞技场Arena AI及官方Qwen Chat。两款模型在预览阶段均仅支持“思考模式”，专注于高难度逻辑推理与深度计算，暂未开放网页搜索及代码解释器。在权威基准测试中，Qwen3.7-Max-Preview综合排名位列全球第13，数学领域排名全球第7，并在专家级应用、软件与IT及编程能力榜单中进入全球前十。Qwen3.7-Plus-Preview则在视觉领域表现突出，综合排名全球第16。此次迭代使通义千问在实验室综合排名中挺进全球前六，视觉榜单排名升至全球第5。该系列模型展现了阿里云在多模态与深度垂直应用领域的研发实力，正式版预计将在即将召开的阿里云峰会上发布。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌联手黑石投资250亿美元组建新型AI云公司挑战英伟达生态</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6142afe7edca818d7c31ba3a72dc38db.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌与私募股权巨头黑石达成合作，计划共同组建一家全新的人工智能云算力公司，整体投资规模达250亿美元。黑石将先行注入50亿美元股权资本，其余资金通过金融杠杆筹集。该新公司核心战略是依托谷歌自研TPU芯片及云基础设施，直接挑战CoreWeave等独立算力服务商。双方计划在2027年上线高达500兆瓦（MW）的算力容量，目前已提前锁定并建设相关数据中心。此举标志着谷歌TPU将大规模推向外部市场，不仅巩固了黑石在AI物理基础设施领域的地位，更将加剧谷歌与英伟达在AI芯片及算力生态领域的正面竞争，对云服务市场格局产生深远影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达正式量产并交付Vera CPU，专为Agentic AI负载打造</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/68a5d3e23d10100cc7d1a0d2944878ca.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达近日宣布首款专为Agentic AI设计的定制CPU——Vera已正式进入量产阶段，并完成向Anthropic、OpenAI、SpaceXAI及甲骨文等顶尖公司的首批交付。Vera CPU搭载88个自研奥林巴斯核心，内存带宽达1.2TB/s，性能较前代Grace CPU提升50%，旨在支持大规模智能体AI工作负载并保持强劲单核性能。甲骨文计划自2026年起部署数十万颗Vera CPU以优化推理效率。英伟达副总裁伊恩・巴克表示，Vera CPU不仅作为独立产品，未来还将与Rubin GPU等系统集成，构建高效计算架构。该处理器的量产将为强化学习、智能体仿真管道及下一代企业级AI提供核心算力支撑，助力Agentic AI生态发展。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI面向ChatGPT Pro用户推出金融工具，支持直连超1.2万家银行账户</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/04bd262e29e0472ec5b42c635c48be1b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日向ChatGPT Pro订阅用户推出个人理财工具预览版，支持美国用户直接绑定银行账户。该功能通过与金融连接服务商Plaid深度合作，实现与第一资本、大通银行、美国运通及嘉信理财等超过1.2万家金融机构的直连。连接后，用户可获取包含投资组合、开销比例、订阅服务及账单提醒的数据仪表盘。此次升级依托GPT-5.5模型在上下文逻辑推理上的增强，支持用户进行深度财务分析与长期规划，如定制买房储蓄计划或分析消费习惯。OpenAI强调隐私控制，用户可随时断开连接并清除财务记忆。此举标志着AI大模型从咨询辅助正式迈向个人资产管理领域，通过实时数据接入提升了AI在复杂财务场景下的决策支持能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cursor发布Composer 2.5编程模型，性能对标GPT-5.5并大幅降低成本</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d706bd5e31e29dbb664027255fa597fb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI代码编辑器Cursor正式发布自研编程模型Composer 2.5，该模型基于月之暗面Kimi K2.5基座微调，通过投入25倍合成数据及85%计算预算用于强化学习，实现了性能飞跃。在SWE-Bench与CursorBench v3.1评测中，Composer 2.5分别取得79.8%和63.2%的成绩，性能平齐Anthropic Opus 4.7及OpenAI GPT-5.5。在成本控制方面，该模型每百万输入/输出代币价格仅为0.50美元和2.50美元，远低于行业主流收费标准。此外，Cursor同步推出高性能变体版本，定价分别为3.00美元和15.00美元。目前，Composer 2.5已在Cursor编辑器全面上线。同时，Cursor正与SpaceX及xAI合作，利用Colossus-2集群的百万级H1</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
